      "source": "SAC Route Portal",
      "notes_html": "<p>Until Rosegg T4: Scrambling passages before Windegg. Esel east face T5+: climbing on schrofen and rock up to the second degree. The route is marked, some passages are equipped with fixed ropes, and the exit to the summit is very (!) exposed. Only to be undertaken in dry conditions!</p>",
